SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The nneexxttaafftteerr(), nneexxttaafftteerrff(), nneexxttaafftteerrll(), nneexxttttoowwaarrdd(), nneexxttttoowwaarrddff(),
     and nneexxttttoowwaarrddll() routines conform to ISO/IEC 9899:1999 (“ISO C99”).
     They implement the Nextafter function recommended by IEEE Std 754-1985,
     with the extension that nneexxttaafftteerr(_+_0_._0, _-_0_._0) returns -0.0, and
     nneexxttaafftteerr(_-_0_._0, _+_0_._0) returns +0.0.

